Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 06:42:44 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Remove examples/config

A module of its own, of the released versions of goda-fi.vim, its UIs
and goda-fi-ext: every release asked to update its go.mod. Its main.go
is the configuration of README.md and of the doc, which say to make the
module (go mod init, go get, go mod tidy) instead of copying it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SYHssS6AaBazouHGF6zQqm
